    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72577" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνοχο-εύω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			21.142
		</span></i> ; part.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.143
				</span></i>
			 ; inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εύειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.127
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				20.234
			</span></i> : but <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> forms obl. tenses from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνοχο-χοέω</span></b> , 
				Ep.
			
			3sg.
			impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνοχόει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.141
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐῳνοχόει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.3
				</span></i>
			 : aor.
			inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνοχοῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					15.323
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
				51.2
			</span></i> : later in pres., <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				70.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.3.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.479
			</span></i> ; part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-οοῦσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1514.32
				</span></i>
			, 
				Aeol.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-όεισα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sapph.
					5
				</span></i>
